      "note": "Reviewed 2026-09-01 at this revision. DECLARED in the pinned package but NO LONGER BUILT by this project: it is a dependency only of the MLXHuggingFace target, whose product this fork stopped linking (see VoiceInkRefineXPC/HuggingFaceTokenizerLoader.swift). CI proves it is out of the build graph by NOT passing -skipMacroValidation: were the macro still in the graph, the build would fail with 'Macro \"MLXHuggingFaceMacros\" ... must be enabled before it can be used' (CI run 33442033271). Source read: SwiftSyntax expression macros emitting adapter shims, no file or network I/O, no process execution."
    },
